  "_comment": "A bare Needs Document URL — a current-state page, not an edition — carried with no rkaf:artifactIdentifierScheme. The scheme tag is REQUIRED (1..*), so the record is rejected. §4.1's immutability rule is itself a producer obligation with no mechanical check, so what the gate catches here is the missing declaration, not the mutability."
